      "description": "Organization-wide, across all stacks and environments. Grafana-reported current monthly billable usage, matching Billing/Usage. Not an invoice or a counter to increase(); delayed updates and fractional estimates are possible. The dashboard time range does not reset the billing period. Missing data stays unavailable. Permanent Free allowance: 50,000. Only collected sessions count; browser sampling and consent exclude sessions.",
